        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8120EN/8106LN, Split Style Elan Lever and Lancaster Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a split style lever and knob set. The Exterior is the Elan Lever with Oval Rose and the Interior is the  Lancaster Knob with Lancaster Rose.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<b>Exterior Elan Leverset with Oval Rose:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>Exterior Elan Leverset with Oval Rose:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>General Specifications</b>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSpecial Ordered Item. <b>No Returns.</b>\r\n</p>",
